    "sentence_translations": [
      "Little Ming Visits a Sick Friend",
      "",
      "Little Ming's classmate Little Qiang got sick, and Little Ming went to the hospital to see him.",
      "",
      "Because Little Ming also had a slight cold, he was taking medicine and felt a bit sleepy.",
      "So he fell asleep against Little Qiang's hospital bed.",
      "Little Ming was sleeping in a daze. He heard someone call for Little Qiang, and randomly replied with a grunt.",
      "He then felt someone touching his hand. He thought it was Little Qiang so he didn't pay much attention.",
      "",
      "Suddenly, Little Ming felt a stinging pain spreading from his hand.",
      "He sat up, opened his eyes, and saw the nurse inserting a needle!",
      "Little Ming panicked and pulled out the needle, while continuously shouting: “It's not me, it's not me.”",
      "At this moment, Little Qiang came out from the bathroom.",
      "As he saw this scene he doubled up with laughter.",
      ""
    ]
